FILE: /Volumes/DAL/Zettelkasten/LLMeon/30_Library/100_zettelkasten/Host-Based Routing Enables Virtual Hosting in Cloud Infrastructure.md
---
aliases: ["L7 Routing", "Virtual Hosting"]
