## LLM Architectural Judgment Gap

AI agents typically possess vast theoretical knowledge but lack the architectural judgment required for complex system design and business-aligned decision-making. Treating agents as ego-free "junior developers" highlights the necessity for constant human oversight to prevent the generation of technically sound but architecturally inappropriate solutions.

