FILE: /Volumes/DAL/Zettelkasten/LLMeon/30_Library/100_zettelkasten/Standard Assessments Are Functionally Obsolete Where AI Can Generate Acceptable Output.md
---
created: 2026-04-10T13:00:00+00:00
modified: 2026-04-10T16:52:03+00:00
tags: [ai-impact, assessment, education, pedagogy]
title: Standard Assessments Are Functionally Obsolete Where AI Can Generate Acceptable Output
---
CONTENT_START:

## Standard Assessments Are Functionally Obsolete Where AI Can Generate Acceptable Output

Standard take-home problem sets and traditional essays are functionally obsolete as measures of student comprehension in any domain where AI can generate an acceptable submission. The assessment measures the output (the artefact), but AI can produce the output without the cognitive process the assessment was designed to verify. This is a structural failure, not a cheating problem—the instrument is broken, not the students.

