The process requires [[Breaking Free from Flawed Models]] and embracing [[Discomfort with Ambiguity Prevents Deeper Thinking|the discomfort of ambiguity]] that comes with questioning fundamental assumptions. Unlike [[SoT - Conventional Problem Solving]], which operates within established paradigms, fundamental insight creation demands [[The Einstellung Effect Prevents Better Solutions|overcoming the Einstellung effect]] to see beyond familiar patterns.

