FILE: /Volumes/DAL/Zettelkasten/LLMeon/30_Library/100_zettelkasten/Process Over Outcome Mindset.md
---
aliases: ["Journey Over Destination", "Learning Process Value", "Process Focus"]
created: 2025-09-11T20:23:33Z
creation_date: "2025-09-11T00:00:00.000Z"
last_reviewed: "null"
modified: 2026-02-01T15:08:28+00:00
status: "null"
tags: ["TheHuman/Health/ADHD", "TheHuman/Mindset", "TheHuman/Motivation", "topic/learning"]
title: Process Over Outcome Mindset
type: "permanent"
updated: 
---
CONTENT_START:

Focusing on the intrinsic value of the learning process itself rather than external outcomes or credentials creates a more sustainable and fulfilling approach to knowledge acquisition. This mindset celebrates the joy of understanding, the satisfaction of curiosity fulfilled, and the neurochemical rewards of discovery.

For [[The ADHD nervous system is primarily interest-driven|interest-driven minds]], this approach aligns with natural motivation patterns. The [[The Aha Moment as a Dopamine Reward|dopamine release from insight]] becomes the primary reward rather than external validation or completion metrics. This prevents [[Goal Displacement]] where the means (credentials, completion) replace the ends (understanding, growth).

---
FILE: /Volumes/DAL/Zettelkasten/LLMeon/30_Library/100_zettelkasten/Routines Must Be Reviewed and Adjusted Regularly.md
---
aliases: ["Regularly Review Your Routines"]
created: 2025-10-29T16:10:00Z
last_reviewed: ""
modified: 2026-02-01T15:08:28+00:00
status: "seedling"
tags: ["adaptability", "continuous-improvement", "routine"]
title: Routines Must Be Reviewed and Adjusted Regularly
type: "principle"
updated: 
---
CONTENT_START:

A routine is not a static object to be created once and followed forever. It is a living system that must be regularly reviewed and adjusted to remain effective as life circumstances, energy levels, and priorities change.

Set aside time for a routine review on a recurring basis, such as monthly or seasonally. This is an opportunity to assess what is working and what is not, and to make intentional tweaks. This iterative process of refinement ensures that the routine continues to serve its purpose as a supportive structure, rather than becoming a source of friction or a rigid set of rules that no longer fit.
---
