## 2. Mechanism: The Four Laws (Atomic Habits)

To build a habit, solve the problem at each stage of the loop.

| Stage | Law (To Build) | Tactic | Inversion (To Break) |
|:--- |:--- |:--- |:--- |
| Cue | Make It Obvious | Implementation Intention: "I will [ACTION] at [TIME]." <br> Environment: Put the fruit on the counter. | Make It Invisible: Hide the phone. |
| Craving | Make It Attractive | Temptation Bundling: Only listen to Podcast X while Running. | Make It Unattractive: Reframe benefit of stopping. |
