## Minimum Viable Understanding (MVU)

Bonhoeffer's theory posits that functional stupidity is not an intellectual failure but a moral and sociological defect where individuals willfully surrender independent thought to align with overwhelming external power. It is more dangerous than malice because it renders the individual immune to reason and capable of any evil while maintaining a clear conscience.

