## Permission Summary Table

| Permission Class | Read | Write | Execute |
|-------------------|------|-------|---------|
| Owner (`bitnami`) | ✔️   | ✔️    | ❌      |
| Group (`bitnami`) | ✔️   | ❌    | ❌      |
| Others            | ✔️   | ❌    | ❌      |
CONTENT_START:

